                    coach_r2_nolp:          `<strong>You left the spread at 65 bp.</strong> A market-making contract is the cleanest lever on the <em>ability</em> to trade — it tightens the spread toward ~40 bp and lowers the transaction cost institutions price in. Demand levers alone leave that cost in place.`,
                    coach_r2_focused:       `<strong>Two or three levers, in order — that is the discipline.</strong> A credible sunset, real independents and a liquidity provider deliver most of the re-rating, and you can see which one moved the needle. The family can live with a sequenced plan it helped shape.`,
                    coach_r2_overhaul:      `<strong>Full board overhaul, compartment move, scrapped voting, a buyback and a global roadshow — all at once.</strong> The family is in revolt and you have no idea which lever worked. Over-engineering with no sequencing burns credibility and coalition. Which two or three changes deliver most of the re-rating, and in what order?`,
